<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>2026-11 on</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2026-11/</link><description>Recent content in 2026-11 on</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en-us</language><lastBuildDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://younsoid.github.io/tags/2026-11/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>폐암 데이터셋</title><link>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs22/</link><pubDate>Sun, 01 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://younsoid.github.io/docs/bioinformatics/research/rs22/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="폐암-데이터셋"&gt;&#10; 폐암 데이터셋&#10; &lt;a class="anchor" href="#%ed%8f%90%ec%95%94-%eb%8d%b0%ec%9d%b4%ed%84%b0%ec%85%8b"&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h1&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;#2026-11-01&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;hr&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;전체 {&amp;#39;LUAD&amp;#39;: 584, &amp;#39;LUSC&amp;#39;: 504} → 코호트(RNA) {&amp;#39;LUAD&amp;#39;: 517, &amp;#39;LUSC&amp;#39;: 501}&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;TCGA-LUAD, LUSC에서 각각 584장, 504장을 다운로드하였다. 분석 코호트는 RNA가 존재하는 517+501명을 사용하였다. (다운로드 방식: GDC API)&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt; LUAD LUSC&#10;MAF 465 463&#10;Meth 414 347&#10;RNA 474 476&#10;RPPA 328 304&#10;miRNA 467 460&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;GDC 포털에서 5가지 오믹스를 다운받았다. 데이터가 존재하는 대상자는 이와 같다.&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;pre tabindex="0"&gt;&lt;code&gt;LUAD: 환자 414 | 탐침 486,427 → cg·마스크·성염색체 442,243 → 결측 400,772 | 대체 0.53%&#10;LUSC: 환자 347 | 탐침 486,427 → cg·마스크·성염색체 442,243 → 결측 397,085 | 대체 0.77%&#10;&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/pre&gt;&lt;p&gt;메틸레이션 데이터는 QC를 해줬고&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>